.* QUISECAUD: DSPSECAUD, the security auditing values.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SAEXIST CLASS=VALCL VALUE='NO'.
:VAR NAME=SARCV CLASS=VALCL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=SARCVLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SACTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SALVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SALVL2 CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
.* The labels are indented with non-breaking blanks.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSECAUD HELP=HLPSEC KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SPACE.Current Security Auditing Values
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=45.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.Security Auditing Journal Values
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SAEXIST USAGE=OUTPUT.  Security journal QAUDJRN exists
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SARCV USAGE=OUTPUT.  Journal receiver attached to QAUDJRN
:DATAI VAR=SARCVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.    Library
:DATAC.
:DATAC.Security Auditing System Values
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SACTL USAGE=OUTPUT.  Current QAUDCTL system value
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SALVL USAGE=OUTPUT.  Current QAUDLVL system value
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SALVL2 USAGE=OUTPUT.  Current QAUDLVL2 system value
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSEC.Current Security Auditing Values - Help
:P.This display shows whether security auditing is set up: whether the
audit journal exists, the receiver attached to it now, and the system
values that say what is audited. CHGSECAUD changes them.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
